; claude: the internet applications -- none yet, a placeholder for the
; category (CATALOG.md gets its section with the first one). Laid out
; like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden frames,
; web/ for the browser.
;
; What it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a web browser (WorldWideWeb 1990, Mosaic 1993): a subset of HTML
;    laid out with the typesetting appkit, links followed;
;  - a mail client (Eudora, 1988): a mailbox, a message, a reply (or in
;    office/, beside the calendar, as Outlook has it -- see
;    plan_gui_remaining.md);
;  - a chat (IRC, 1988): channels and nicknames over a connection;
;  - a news reader (Usenet's rn/trn): threads of articles.
; Built on networking/ and gui/, the servers they talk to small enough
; to run beside them.
